	(text "Dry-contact inputs (leak / level float / lid switch): contact to GND. 10k pull-up, 1k + 100n RC, TPD4E05U06 ESD, J10 JST PH 5p (1-4 IN, 5 GND) -> ESP32 GPIO10 / 11 / 4 / 15."
